invariant: INV-41
file: Makefile
catches: test/widemul-builds.sh
reason: make writes CH_X25519_ADX_MODEL for every host object, so
  x25519_adx.c would read test/x25519_adx_model.h, portable C in place of
  its five assembly operations, and a session with CH_CPU_BMI2_ADX would run
  test code that no library build may hold. test/widemul-builds.sh refuses a
  host object's defines that name it.

--- old
             $(CPU_RUNTIME_DEF))
--- new
             $(CPU_RUNTIME_DEF) $(if $(CPU_RUNTIME_DEF),-DCH_X25519_ADX_MODEL))
